<h1>Get321Settings</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Runs the wizard for new 321 transformation and initialises temporary parameters for the target entities.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Dialog:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription" style="font-weight:bold;"><img src="../Images/get321.gif" width="387px" height="359px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Parameters:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>CoordFrame</b></i></span> – choose from the drop-down box the target co-ordinate frame.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Axis</b></i></span> - choose from the drop-down box the target axis</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>XOrigin</b></i></span> - type X co-ordinate value</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>YOrigin</b></i></span> - type Y co-ordinate value</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>ZOrigin</b></i></span> - type Z co-ordinate value</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Direct input of the parameter values is not allowed. The command is started with <a href="../Parameter_Types.htm#Temporary%20parameters">temporary parameters</a>, that are initialised through this dialog.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example</p>
<p class="ExampleCode" style="font-family:Courier New;">Get321Settings( CoordFrame=&amp;frame, Axis=&amp;axis, XOrigin=&amp;x, YOrigin=&amp;y, ZOrigin=&amp;z)</p>
